<title>Netherlands: WEGENER BUYS STAKE IN BELGIAN FIRM.</title>
<headline>WEGENER BUYS STAKE IN BELGIAN FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>APELDOORN, Netherlands 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher Wegener NV said on Friday it was acquiring a 45 percent stake in a Belgian direct marketing firm.  </p>
<p>Wegener said in a press release it was in talks with the Sopres Group in Brussels on acquiring a 45 percent stake in direct marketing firm Sopres.</p>
<p>Sopres expects an annual turnover of over one billion Belgian francs in 1997.</p>
<p>Sopres Group includes Sopres Belgium, Sopres France, Pin Point Marketing, Jottrand NV, Direct Porduction Nv, Dacoteam NV, Q Master Belgium NV and Highway NV.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
